<title>USA: Alanco sees FY97 EPS of $0.08.</title>
<headline>Alanco sees FY97 EPS of $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alanco Environmental Resources Corp said Wednesday it expects to triple its sales in fiscal 1997, ending June 30, 1997, to $15.18 million and earnings of $0.08 a share.</p>
<p>In a statement, it reported fiscal 1996 sales of $4.96 million, up 44 percent from one year ago. Its net loss narrowed to $3.53 million, or $0.11 a share, from $4.75 million, or $0.20 a share, one year ago.</p>
</text>
